  _speakerName: Seraphine
  _dialogueSegments:
  - A traveller... It has been some time since anyone ventured this far.
  - These crossroads were once filled with life. Now, only the lost and the desperate
    seem to find their way here.
  - Tell me, stranger... what brings you to these lands?
